<title>TANZANIA: Tanzania shilling strengthens on dollar, pound.</title>
<headline>Tanzania shilling strengthens on dollar, pound.</headline>
<dateline>DAR ES SALAAM 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Tanzania shilling strengthened against the dollar and pound on Thursday, according to central bank figures.</p>
<p>The shilling traded at a mean rate of 590.4261 against the dollar from 590.4360 on Wednesday. Against the pound, the shilling traded at mean rate 921.6581 from 923.7401 on Wednesday, dealers said.</p>
<p>--Nairobi Newsroom +254 2 330-261</p>
